I love the rainbows that appear after a summer shower. 

The sky is grey and sad, but then the sun comes out. Suddenly, a bright arch of colour appears. I see red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, and violet. 

My favourite part is the end of the rainbow. I always look for a pot of gold, but I only find a puddle to jump in! 

These rainbows make me feel happy. They remind me that even after a storm, there is always something beautiful to see. [end of text]


